WEBVTT

00:05:29.871 --> 00:05:32.862
and you have obstacles
in front of you, as we all do.

00:05:32.886 --> 00:05:35.300
None of us ever get through this life

00:05:36.538 --> 00:05:37.860
without heartache,

00:05:40.058 --> 00:05:41.323
without turmoil,

00:05:42.379 --> 00:05:45.173
and if you believe and you have faith

00:05:45.197 --> 00:05:47.569
and you can get knocked down
and get back up again

00:05:47.593 --> 00:05:50.494
and you believe in perseverance

00:05:50.518 --> 00:05:54.136
as a great human quality,

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.449
you find your way.

00:05:55.473 --> 00:05:57.094
And Bonnie grabbed my shoulders,

00:05:57.118 --> 00:06:00.238
and she said, "Let's find
our way to Florida."